feat(admin): add monthly expenses calendar with CRUD

New admin tool to track recurring business payments (servidor, dominio,
suscripciones). Visual monthly calendar with prev/next navigation, today
highlight, expense pills on each due day, and clamp logic for months
without day 31. Side panel with add/edit/delete form, ARS/USD support,
optional notes, and live stats (count, ARS total, USD total, next
payment countdown).

- backend/database.py: new recurring_expenses table + CRUD methods
  (get_expenses, add_expense, update_expense, delete_expense) with
  shared input validation.
- backend/server.py: /api/admin/expenses (GET, POST) and
  /api/admin/expenses/<id> (PUT, DELETE), all admin_required.
- ui/admin/expenses.html: full calendar UI with form, list, stats.
  Auto-served by the admin router (no extra Flask route needed).
- ui/admin/index.html: dashboard card linking to the new page.
- ui/admin/orders.html, ps-accounts.html, hot_titles.html: nav links.
